Package: waifem
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Time-Series and Fiscal Tools for the WAIFEM Module III Training
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("William G.", "Cantah", email = "wgcantah@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helper functions used in the WAIFEM (West African Institute for
    Financial and Economic Management) Module III training on Bayesian
    macroeconometrics for central banks and ministries of finance. Includes
    forward filtering backward sampling (FFBS) and Gibbs samplers for the
    time-varying parameter AR(1) model with and without stochastic volatility,
    ARCH/GARCH volatility tools, Bayesian fiscal regression with revenue and
    primary-balance scenarios, and model evaluation tools (posterior predictive
    checks, PIT, pointwise log-likelihoods for WAIC/LOO, g-prior Bayes factors,
    leave-future-out validation). Ships the simulated teaching data set.
